  "contract": "#12932: Elydna Wingstroke (161784) appeared as a Tauren. Her stand-in display 17849 (Night Elf female, rev_20260924_10_coa_teldrassil_vulture_cult.sql; the live 652029 is in no client archive) has creature_model_info.DisplayID_Other_Gender 17850, a Tauren female, and ObjectMgr::GetCreatureModelRandomGender picks it on half of all creations. The fix gives her display 13403, a Night Elf female (model 56) with no other-gender partner; 17849 stays for the stock Fallen Druid 18490. Each of 20 creations must keep 13403: with the old data each has a 50% chance of 17850, so a false pass is about 1e-6.",
